          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kigechob Topet koboch keny; ee, kigechopchi laitoriat; kigoyai kolooit kwo ng’ony ak kotebeesit: karurugutiennyi ko mat ak kwenik che chang’; inaami kabusetab Jehovah, ne kergei ak koik che laldos, che isururu.",
